{"prompt": {"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant that translates C++ code to Java 8 code. The code should reads and writes I/O from the console."}, {"role": "user", "content": "Translate the following GNU C++14 code to Java 8 code. The code reads and writes I/O from the console. Your translated code should have the exact same functionality as the given code, meaning that it should have the same output for any given input.\nPrint your translated code and also the confidence score you give to your translation. The confidence score should be a number between 0 and 1. The format of the output should be:\n<translated_code>\n<your_translated_code>\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n<your_confidence_score>\n</confidence>\nDo not provide any other text or markdown fences.\n\nHere is the original GNU C++14 code you have to translate:\n<original_code>\n/*\n * shoflk kalba.cpp\n *\n *  Created on: Sep 17, 2016\n *      Author: A7mD Sa3iiD\n *\t\ttime: 11:15:28 PM\n */\n\n#include <bits/stdc++.h>\nusing namespace std;\n\ntypedef long long ll;\ntypedef pair<int, int> pii;\n\nconst double EPS = 1e-15;\n\npii reduce_fraction(int a, int b) {\n    int g = __gcd(a, b);\n    return {a / g, b / g};\n}\n\nint main() {\n    ios::sync_with_stdio(false);\n    cin.tie(nullptr);\n    \n    double x, y, n_double;\n    cin >> x >> y >> n_double;\n    int n = static_cast<int>(n_double);\n    \n    double ratio = x / y;\n    pii best = {0, 1};\n    double min_diff = numeric_limits<double>::max();\n    \n    for (int i = 1; i <= n; ++i) {\n        double scaled = ratio * i;\n        int floor_val = static_cast<int>(floor(scaled + EPS));\n        int ceil_val = static_cast<int>(ceil(scaled - EPS));\n        \n        auto try_candidate = [&](int num, int den) {\n            double approx = static_cast<double>(num) / den;\n            double diff = fabs(ratio - approx);\n            if (diff < min_diff - EPS || (fabs(diff - min_diff) < EPS && den < best.second)) {\n                min_diff = diff;\n                best = {num, den};\n            }\n        };\n        \n        try_candidate(floor_val, i);\n        try_candidate(ceil_val, i);\n    }\n    \n    pii reduced = reduce_fraction(best.first, best.second);\n    cout << reduced.first << \"/\" << reduced.second << \"\\n\";\n    \n    return 0;\n}\n</original_code>\n"}], "temp": 0, "sample_size": 1, "logprobs": true, "model": "qwen/qwen3-coder-next"}, "response": {"samples": [{"content": "<translated_code>\nimport java.util.*;\n\npublic class Main {\n    static class Pair {\n        int first;\n        int second;\n        \n        Pair(int first, int second) {\n            this.first = first;\n            this.second = second;\n        }\n    }\n    \n    static int gcd(int a, int b) {\n        if (b == 0) return a;\n        return gcd(b, a % b);\n    }\n    \n    static Pair reduce_fraction(int a, int b) {\n        int g = gcd(a, b);\n        return new Pair(a / g, b / g);\n    }\n    \n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        Scanner scanner = new Scanner(System.in);\n        \n        double x = scanner.nextDouble();\n        double y = scanner.nextDouble();\n        double n_double = scanner.nextDouble();\n        int n = (int) n_double;\n        \n        double ratio = x / y;\n        Pair best = new Pair(0, 1);\n        double min_diff = Double.MAX_VALUE;\n        \n        for (int i = 1; i <= n; ++i) {\n            double scaled = ratio * i;\n            int floor_val = (int) Math.floor(scaled + 1e-15);\n            int ceil_val = (int) Math.ceil(scaled - 1e-15);\n            \n            // Try floor candidate\n            double approx1 = (double) floor_val / i;\n            double diff1 = Math.abs(ratio - approx1);\n            if (diff1 < min_diff - 1e-15 || (Math.abs(diff1 - min_diff) < 1e-15 && i < best.second)) {\n                min_diff = diff1;\n                best = new Pair(floor_val, i);\n            }\n            \n            // Try ceil candidate\n            double approx2 = (double) ceil_val / i;\n            double diff2 = Math.abs(ratio - approx2);\n            if (diff2 < min_diff - 1e-15 || (Math.abs(diff2 - min_diff) < 1e-15 && i < best.second)) {\n                min_diff = diff2;\n                best = new Pair(ceil_val, i);\n            }\n        }\n        \n        Pair reduced = reduce_fraction(best.first, best.second);\n        System.out.println(reduced.first + \"/\" + reduced.second);\n    }\n}\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n0.95\n</confidence>", "token_logprobs": [-0.00015400654228869826, -1.2874520507466514e-05, -4.768370445162873e-07, -0.00054058717796579, -1.0490362910786644e-05, -0.009117752313613892, -0.35082465410232544, -1.8596476365928538e-05, -1.6689286894688848e-06, -0.0007109498255886137, -0.05488331988453865, -0.012517577037215233, -0.2816547453403473, -0.061824969947338104, -0.004786699544638395, -3.755022044060752e-05, -8.344646857949556e-07, -0.0036087408661842346, -0.00010680581908673048, -0.00017975145601667464, -5.8412379075889476e-06, -1.4305104514278355e-06, -1.2993727978027891e-05, -0.0001481661747675389, -0.20141509175300598, -2.3007127310847864e-05, -0.014181431382894516, -3.814689989667386e-06, -0.3351939916610718, 0.0, -8.344646857949556e-07, -4.768360213347478e-06, -4.768370445162873e-07, 0.0, -2.109982233378105e-05, -8.701899787411094e-05, -1.9073468138230965e-06, 0.0, -2.264974000354414e-06, -4.291525328881107e-06, -1.0728830375228426e-06, -2.0265373677830212e-05, -6.305972783593461e-05, 0.0, -0.0001003691868390888, -5.960462772236497e-07, -4.768370445162873e-07, -1.5497195136049413e-06, -0.08894185721874237, -0.009760040789842606, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -3.576278118089249e-07, -0.007155624218285084, -0.04179343208670616, -4.792098479811102e-05, -1.311301275563892e-06, -7.152555099310121e-07, 0.0, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -1.1920922133867862e-06, 0.0, -1.5497195136049413e-06, -0.18489935994148254, 0.0, -4.05310